Company uses different methods to measure different types of risk to which it is exposed. These methods include sensitivity analysis
in the case of interest rate and foreign exchange risks, ageing analysis for credit risk, and analysis of cash flow forecasts and maturity
profiles in respect of liquidity risk.</FONT></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

